# Client data never belongs in this public repo, and agents stage with `git add -A`. So data files
# are ignored by default; a new fixture directory is added to the un-ignore list below. This is a
# default, not a boundary: `git add -f` still adds anything. Order matters, a later rule wins.
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.pdf

# Directories that hold fixtures.
!apps/web/sample-reports/**/*.csv
!apps/web/sample-reports/**/*.xlsx
!apps/web/sample-reports/**/*.xlsm
!apps/web/sample-reports/**/*.xls
!apps/web/sample-reports/**/*.pdf
!apps/web/src/lib/reports/excel/testing/fixtures/**/*.csv
!apps/web/src/lib/reports/excel/testing/fixtures/**/*.xlsx
!apps/web/src/lib/reports/excel/testing/fixtures/**/*.xlsm
!apps/web/src/lib/reports/excel/testing/fixtures/**/*.xls
!apps/web/src/lib/reports/excel/testing/fixtures/**/*.pdf
!python/insights/tests/data/**/*.csv
!python/insights/tests/data/**/*.xlsx
!python/insights/tests/data/**/*.xlsm
!python/insights/tests/data/**/*.xls
!python/insights/tests/data/**/*.pdf
!python/lab/test_data/**/*.csv
!python/lab/test_data/**/*.xlsx
!python/lab/test_data/**/*.xlsm
!python/lab/test_data/**/*.xls
!python/lab/test_data/**/*.pdf
